{"seq":3,"slug":"openclaw-outbound-webhooks","title":"OpenClaw outbound webhooks 与 HMAC 签名模型","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/hooks-transform-pipeline/openclaw-outbound-webhooks","wordCount":1089,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"openclaw-outbound-webhooks-与-hmac-签名模型\">OpenClaw outbound webhooks 与 HMAC 签名模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>OpenClaw 的事件出站走 <strong>outbound webhooks</strong>——内部任何 persona 切换、消息路由、审计动作、租户生命周期变更，都会被序列化为 HTTP POST 推送到 admin 预先注册的 URL。这是 OpenClaw 与第三方系统（Hermes / 自建 n8n / Temporal / 内部 SIEM）集成的主要通道。webhook 模型在 Hermes 三子系统的 Shell 层有对应物，但 OpenClaw 把它做得更&quot;productized&quot;：声明式触发条件 / 标准 payload schema / 指数退避重试 / idempotency key 去重 / HMAC SHA-256 签名。配合 Hermes Gateway 订阅 OpenClaw webhook 这条路径，两个 personal-agent 工具栈就能在不直接耦合 internal API 的前提下做事件级联动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  OC[OpenClaw runtime] --&gt; EV[Event detected]&#10;  EV --&gt; RT[Trigger router]&#10;  RT --&gt; SG[Sign with HMAC]&#10;  SG --&gt; Q[Outbound queue]&#10;  Q --&gt; HTTP[HTTP POST]&#10;  HTTP --&gt; EX[External webhook URL]&#10;  EX -. 200 OK .-&gt; ACK[Mark delivered]&#10;  EX -. timeout/5xx .-&gt; RETRY[Exp backoff retry]\">flowchart LR\n  OC[OpenClaw runtime] --&gt; EV[Event detected]\n  EV --&gt; RT[Trigger router]\n  RT --&gt; SG[Sign with HMAC]\n  SG --&gt; Q[Outbound queue]\n  Q --&gt; HTTP[HTTP POST]\n  HTTP --&gt; EX[External webhook URL]\n  EX -. 200 OK .-&gt; ACK[Mark delivered]\n  EX -. timeout/5xx .-&gt; RETRY[Exp backoff retry]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>event_type 取值</th>\n<th>业务含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>persona 创建/切换/销毁</td>\n<td><code>persona_switch</code></td>\n<td>多租户身份变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息进入路由决策</td>\n<td><code>message_route</code></td>\n<td>inbound 流量记账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审计敏感动作</td>\n<td><code>audit_event</code></td>\n<td>合规与安全告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>租户生命周期</td>\n<td><code>tenant_lifecycle</code></td>\n<td>创建/暂停/恢复/删除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"触发条件清单\">触发条件清单</h2><p>OpenClaw 不允许&quot;任意 internal event 都 emit webhook&quot;——这会让 admin 被海量噪音淹没。webhook 触发条件被限定在 4 个 event_type，每个都有明确语义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>event_type</th>\n<th>子动作</th>\n<th>触发频率上限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>persona_switch</td>\n<td>create / activate / suspend / destroy</td>\n<td>per-persona-per-second 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>message_route</td>\n<td>matched / fallback / rejected</td>\n<td>per-channel-per-second 10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>audit_event</td>\n<td>secret_access / cross_persona_attempt / compliance_export</td>\n<td>无限（必送）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tenant_lifecycle</td>\n<td>provision / upgrade / suspend / terminate</td>\n<td>per-tenant-per-day 100</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>audit_event 是唯一不限速的——合规相关事件必须保证送达。其他三类有 rate limit 的话，触发频次会先在 OpenClaw 内部聚合，超出窗口的合并为 batch event 一次性 push。</p>\n<h2 id=\"payload-schema\">payload schema</h2><p>所有 webhook 共享统一外层 schema，差异只在 <code>payload</code> 内层字段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;event_id&quot;: &quot;evt_oc_8a3c91&quot;,&#10;  &quot;event_type&quot;: &quot;persona_switch&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tenant&quot;: &quot;wangyang&quot;,&#10;  &quot;persona&quot;: &quot;dev_oss&quot;,&#10;  &quot;timestamp&quot;: &quot;2026-05-14T03:21:09.482Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;idempotency_key&quot;: &quot;ps_2026-05-14T03:21:09.482Z_wangyang_dev_oss&quot;,&#10;  &quot;payload&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;sub_action&quot;: &quot;activate&quot;,&#10;    &quot;previous_persona&quot;: &quot;dev_bytedance&quot;,&#10;    &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;lark_oc_abc&quot;,&#10;    &quot;actor&quot;: &quot;ou_xyz&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"event_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"evt_oc_8a3c91\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"event_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"persona_switch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tenant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"wangyang\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"persona\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dev_oss\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"timestamp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-05-14T03:21:09.482Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"idempotency_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ps_2026-05-14T03:21:09.482Z_wangyang_dev_oss\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"payload\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sub_action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"activate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"previous_persona\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dev_bytedance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lark_oc_abc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"actor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ou_xyz\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>必填</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>event_id</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>全局唯一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>event_type</td>\n<td>enum</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>4 个枚举之一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tenant</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>OpenClaw 租户 ID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>persona</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>maybe</td>\n<td>tenant_lifecycle 可缺省</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>timestamp</td>\n<td>ISO 8601</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>服务端生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>idempotency_key</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>去重用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>payload</td>\n<td>object</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>event-specific</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"hmac-sha-256-签名\">HMAC SHA-256 签名</h2><p>接收端如何验证一条 POST 真来自 OpenClaw 而非伪造？OpenClaw 用 HMAC SHA-256 对 body 与 timestamp 一起签名，附在专属 header：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"X-OpenClaw-Signature: t=1715670069,v1=4e8b...c2a1&#10;X-OpenClaw-Event-Id: evt_oc_8a3c91&#10;X-OpenClaw-Event-Type: persona_switch\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>X-OpenClaw-Signature: t=1715670069,v1=4e8b...c2a1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X-OpenClaw-Event-Id: evt_oc_8a3c91</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X-OpenClaw-Event-Type: persona_switch</span></span></code></pre></div><p>签名材料是 <code>f&quot;{t}.{raw_body}&quot;</code>。验证步骤：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def verify(headers, raw_body, secret):&#10;    sig_header = headers[&quot;X-OpenClaw-Signature&quot;]&#10;    parts = dict(p.split(&quot;=&quot;) for p in sig_header.split(&quot;,&quot;))&#10;    t = parts[&quot;t&quot;]&#10;    v1 = parts[&quot;v1&quot;]&#10;    # 1. 时间窗（默认 5 min）防 replay&#10;    if abs(now() - int(t)) &gt; 300:&#10;        raise ReplayAttack&#10;    # 2. HMAC 验证&#10;    expected = hmac.new(&#10;        secret.encode(),&#10;        f&quot;{t}.{raw_body}&quot;.encode(),&#10;        hashlib.sha256&#10;    ).hexdigest()&#10;    # 3. 常时比较防 timing attack&#10;    if not hmac.compare_digest(expected, v1):&#10;        raise SignatureInvalid&#10;    return True\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> verify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(headers, raw_body, secret):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sig_header </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> headers[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"X-OpenClaw-Signature\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    parts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p.split(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"=\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sig_header.split(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\",\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parts[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"t\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    v1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parts[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"v1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 1. 时间窗（默认 5 min）防 replay</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(now() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        raise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ReplayAttack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 2. HMAC 验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    expected </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hmac.new(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        secret.encode(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">t</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">raw_body</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encode(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        hashlib.sha256</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ).hexdigest()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 3. 常时比较防 timing attack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hmac.compare_digest(expected, v1):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        raise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SignatureInvalid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant OC as OpenClaw&#10;  participant EX as External endpoint&#10;  OC-&gt;&gt;OC: build body&#10;  OC-&gt;&gt;OC: t = now() unix&#10;  OC-&gt;&gt;OC: sig = HMAC(secret, t + &quot;.&quot; + body)&#10;  OC-&gt;&gt;EX: POST + X-OpenClaw-Signature: t,v1=sig&#10;  EX-&gt;&gt;EX: 1. check |now - t| &lt; 300s&#10;  EX-&gt;&gt;EX: 2. recompute HMAC&#10;  EX-&gt;&gt;EX: 3. compare_digest&#10;  EX--&gt;&gt;OC: 200 OK\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant OC as OpenClaw\n  participant EX as External endpoint\n  OC-&gt;&gt;OC: build body\n  OC-&gt;&gt;OC: t = now() unix\n  OC-&gt;&gt;OC: sig = HMAC(secret, t + \".\" + body)\n  OC-&gt;&gt;EX: POST + X-OpenClaw-Signature: t,v1=sig\n  EX-&gt;&gt;EX: 1. check |now - t| &lt; 300s\n  EX-&gt;&gt;EX: 2. recompute HMAC\n  EX-&gt;&gt;EX: 3. compare_digest\n  EX--&gt;&gt;OC: 200 OK</pre><p>secret 通过 OpenClaw admin UI 注册，per-tenant 独立。轮换 secret 时支持 grace period——新旧 secret 同时有效 24 小时让接收端平滑切换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重试与去重\">重试与去重</h2><p>OpenClaw 把 webhook 视为 at-least-once delivery：如果接收端没在 5 秒内返回 2xx，或返回 5xx，OpenClaw 把消息回放进重试队列：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  S1[Try 1] -. fail .-&gt; W1[wait 1s]&#10;  W1 --&gt; S2[Try 2]&#10;  S2 -. fail .-&gt; W2[wait 4s]&#10;  W2 --&gt; S3[Try 3]&#10;  S3 -. fail .-&gt; W3[wait 16s]&#10;  W3 --&gt; S4[Try 4]&#10;  S4 -. fail .-&gt; W4[wait 64s]&#10;  W4 --&gt; S5[Try 5]&#10;  S5 -. fail .-&gt; DLQ[Dead letter queue]\">flowchart LR\n  S1[Try 1] -. fail .-&gt; W1[wait 1s]\n  W1 --&gt; S2[Try 2]\n  S2 -. fail .-&gt; W2[wait 4s]\n  W2 --&gt; S3[Try 3]\n  S3 -. fail .-&gt; W3[wait 16s]\n  W3 --&gt; S4[Try 4]\n  S4 -. fail .-&gt; W4[wait 64s]\n  W4 --&gt; S5[Try 5]\n  S5 -. fail .-&gt; DLQ[Dead letter queue]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>尝试</th>\n<th>等待时间</th>\n<th>累计时长</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>try 1</td>\n<td>0s</td>\n<td>0s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>try 2</td>\n<td>1s</td>\n<td>1s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>try 3</td>\n<td>4s</td>\n<td>5s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>try 4</td>\n<td>16s</td>\n<td>21s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>try 5</td>\n<td>64s</td>\n<td>85s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>DLQ</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>at-least-once 意味着接收端<strong>必须实现幂等</strong>。OpenClaw 提供 <code>idempotency_key</code> 字段让接收端在自家 db 用 unique index 拒绝重复处理。典型实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def receive(payload):&#10;    if db.exists(&quot;webhook_dedup&quot;, key=payload[&quot;idempotency_key&quot;]):&#10;        return &quot;200 already processed&quot;&#10;    db.insert(&quot;webhook_dedup&quot;, key=payload[&quot;idempotency_key&quot;])&#10;    process(payload)&#10;    return &quot;200 ok&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> receive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(payload):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.exists(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"webhook_dedup\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">payload[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"idempotency_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"200 already processed\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    db.insert(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"webhook_dedup\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">payload[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"idempotency_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    process(payload)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"200 ok\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与-hermes-gateway-的桥接\">与 Hermes Gateway 的桥接</h2><p>Hermes Gateway 的 HTTP listener 天然可作为 OpenClaw webhook 接收端：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  OC[OpenClaw event] --&gt; WH[OpenClaw outbound webhook]&#10;  WH --&gt; HG[Hermes Gateway /webhook]&#10;  HG --&gt; EVT[Internal event]&#10;  EVT --&gt; PL[Hermes Plugin]&#10;  PL --&gt; SH[Hermes Shell]\">flowchart LR\n  OC[OpenClaw event] --&gt; WH[OpenClaw outbound webhook]\n  WH --&gt; HG[Hermes Gateway /webhook]\n  HG --&gt; EVT[Internal event]\n  EVT --&gt; PL[Hermes Plugin]\n  PL --&gt; SH[Hermes Shell]</pre><p>接入步骤：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>OpenClaw admin 注册 webhook URL <code>https://hermes.local/webhook/openclaw</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>复制 OpenClaw 给的 webhook secret，存入 <code>~/.learnwy/hermes/secrets/openclaw.key</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Hermes Gateway 配置 <code>listeners.http.signature_verify = &quot;openclaw&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Hermes Plugin 订阅 event_type <code>openclaw_persona_switch</code> 等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>桥接后，OpenClaw 的 persona 切换可以触发 Hermes 调整 memory 视图，OpenClaw 的 audit_event 可以让 Hermes 的 skill_manage 自动 disable 风险 skill——两个工具栈在不直接共享 internal API 的前提下达到事件级联动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>接收端不校 timestamp 仅校 HMAC</strong>：攻击者抓取一次合法 POST 后无限 replay。timestamp window 必须强制。</li>\n<li><strong>idempotency_key 用 event_id</strong>：两者不一定相同——event_id 是 OpenClaw 内部 ID，idempotency_key 是 delivery-level 标识，retry 时 event_id 不变但 idempotency_key 保持一致即可。</li>\n<li><strong>DLQ 不监控</strong>：消息进 DLQ 但 admin 没告警，故障静默累积。OpenClaw 提供 <code>dlq_alert_webhook</code> 二级配置，DLQ 累积超阈值时单独 push。</li>\n<li><strong>接收端 5xx 但 OpenClaw 收到 2xx</strong>：例如反向代理把 5xx 改写为 200。务必让 webhook 端点直连，不经反代或确保反代透传状态码。</li>\n<li><strong>secret 写进 git</strong>：webhook secret 必须用 keychain / vault 保存，不能进版本控制。OpenClaw 推荐 1Password CLI / macOS Keychain。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>OpenClaw 的 outbound webhook 模型用&quot;声明式触发 + 标准 schema + HMAC 签名 + 指数退避重试 + idempotency key&quot;五件套，把&quot;OpenClaw → 外部系统&quot;的事件流量做成生产可用的协议。HMAC + timestamp 双重防御让伪造和 replay 都被堵死，at-least-once + idempotency 让接收端可以放心实现&quot;宁可重收也不丢&quot;的语义。和 Hermes Gateway 的 HTTP listener 配合，两个 personal-agent 工具栈可以在没有 internal API 耦合的前提下做事件级联动。下一篇看 transform pipeline 如何与 Tier 1 Hook 协作出更强力的工作流。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"OpenClaw outbound webhooks 与 HMAC 签名模型","id":"openclaw-outbound-webhooks-与-hmac-签名模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"触发条件清单","id":"触发条件清单"},{"level":2,"text":"payload schema","id":"payload-schema"},{"level":2,"text":"HMAC SHA-256 签名","id":"hmac-sha-256-签名"},{"level":2,"text":"重试与去重","id":"重试与去重"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Hermes Gateway 的桥接","id":"与-hermes-gateway-的桥接"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"transform\\_\\* 管线的链式调用语义","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/hooks-transform-pipeline/transform-pipeline-design"},"next":{"title":"与 Tier 1 Hooks 协同的跨 tier 桥接模式","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/hooks-transform-pipeline/hooks-with-tier-1-bridge"}}